{"version":1,"content":"<p>消防處於下午1時10分起的20分鐘內，接獲105宗困𨋢報告，全數集中於九龍及新界多區，包括觀塘、荃灣、上水、尖沙嘴等。</p><p>有醫院、商場升降機、電梯也一度停運，有人被困。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:40:24.439944+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T06:32:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:18:45.301800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:37:53.466676+00:00","content_hash":"d63fbf4020e096f03132ecc7cabb7a91f708a79dd89e05b2aa56b950eddfb63d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}